00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:59.010
City of Dead Ends

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:00.020
Reona!

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:02.350
Come here! It's a big one!

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:05.440
Hey! Did you hear me?! Reona!

00:02:05.440 --> 00:02:07.110
Oh? Oh my goodness.

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:09.190
It was that big?

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:10.650
Good for you.

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:13.450
No, you've got it all wrong!

00:02:21.950 --> 00:02:24.750
Hiro, are ya all right?

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:27.130
Mizarisa!

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:30.880
W-Were you the one that saved me?

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:32.130
Yup!

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:36.470
I followed you and
snuck up to the bathroom!

00:02:36.470 --> 00:02:41.270
I was excited to witness ya
in action again, but...

00:02:41.270 --> 00:02:45.190
...to my surprise,
a goblin had beaten me to it!

00:02:45.190 --> 00:02:50.400
So then I cut his head off from behind!

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:54.280
His guard was down, so it was easy peasy!

00:02:54.280 --> 00:02:57.570
I have objections, but I'll take it.

00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:59.320
Th-Thanks.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:01.160
Don't mention it.

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:04.750
Hey, Hiro, have you been taking care of
your sword?

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:07.120
Ya can't have a rusty sword.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.210
Yeah, I have.

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:12.840
Have you? Lemme see.

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:25.100
What the hell, you sadist pervert?!

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:29.900
Oh! Such a teensy stab
gets such a big reaction!

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:32.320
Hiro, you're fantastic!

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:36.650
The creepy girl is gone,
and we're finally alone!

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:41.370
Come on! Let me see
what other faces you make!

00:03:41.370 --> 00:03:43.660
S-Stop it!

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:46.580
Now? You must be joking!

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:49.460
It won't be all pain.

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:51.710
I'll also make ya feel good.

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:54.840
Y-You're just trying to trick me again!

00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:57.510
Not at all!

00:03:57.510 --> 00:03:59.430
I'll prove it.

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:02.180
Look!

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:05.020
You're welcome to feel them.

00:04:05.020 --> 00:04:06.980
Wait, seriously?

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:09.310
Eighteen plus mode is happening <i>now</i>?

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:11.770
Not what I wanted at all!

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:18.280
What's wrong with you two?

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:22.530
This is no time for this nonsense!

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:25.910
You ruined it, you freak!

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:29.580
What's that? Bring it, pervert.
I'll chop you up!

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:30.920
Fine by me!

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:33.380
Chop me up then, if ya think ya can!

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:35.920
S-Stop this!

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:38.470
We need to go find Tesla!

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:41.930
We're sitting ducks for the goblins here!

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:44.760
Hey, Hiro, wait for me!

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:47.640
Hiro, get back here!

00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:53.360
Yikes!

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:57.530
Those two will kill me
before the goblins get the chance!

00:04:57.530 --> 00:04:59.490
Better to let the goblins kill me--

00:04:59.490 --> 00:05:03.620
Wait, that's some negative thinking!

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:06.160
Reona! Where were you?

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:09.790
A goblin and Mizarisa nearly got me in the
bathroom!

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:10.750
Sorry.

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:13.040
I had a lot going on.

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:15.340
Huh? What happened?

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:17.210
See for yourself.

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:19.300
See? Look at all the split ends!

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:25.260
Do you actually want me
to beat this game?!

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:26.760
Oh, come on!

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:29.220
I just went to the bathroom!

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:35.190
Hmm. Maybe it's an event that
continues as long as you're nervous.

00:05:35.190 --> 00:05:38.030
There're events like that?!

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:39.490
Shit!

00:05:39.490 --> 00:05:42.820
You mean I'm gonna fail
because of nerves again?!

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:45.160
"Again"? What do you mean?

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:48.330
W-Well...

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:52.250
Listen, why don't you tell me?
About your past.

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:54.790
But what about the goblins?

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:59.670
You can't defeat the goblins if you don't
take care of this stomach pain first!

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:01.090
Right?

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:03.680
Th-That's true, but...

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:06.510
Hiro, I'm an adult. Talk to me.

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:11.520
I won't make fun of you over
something so serious. Trust me.

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:15.560
Okay.

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:17.400
Well, you see...

00:06:20.820 --> 00:06:24.780
So you got a Nice Shower title
in real life, too!

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:27.240
That's too funny!

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:29.580
She's making tons of fun of me!

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:32.450
I'm an idiot for trusting you!

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:35.540
KQ is a game that stays true to real life.

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:39.960
Basically, just like with your
poop accident at the track meet,

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:43.050
in game you'll keep having to poop!

00:06:43.050 --> 00:06:45.630
I didn't poop myself though!

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:49.510
Whether you did or didn't poop yourself,
it doesn't really matter.

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:54.310
Of course it does! Come on! And how
many times are you gonna say "poop"?

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:58.310
Now, now. Anyway, here's
what I bet Kamui would say:

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:02.480
"How long are you gonna let
that bother you, you little bitch?

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:05.570
Run with shit sliding out
if you have to!"

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:08.910
I said I didn't defecate!

00:07:08.910 --> 00:07:11.660
And who could run while pooping?!

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:13.410
So, how's your tummy?

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:14.620
Huh?

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:18.830
What? I think it stopped hurting.

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:22.760
Reona, that was all on purpose?

00:07:22.760 --> 00:07:25.670
Did I manage to help?

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:28.300
Y-Yes. Thanks.

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:32.010
Though I'm not sure I should be grateful.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:35.520
Hiro! A new title!

00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:38.230
N-Now?!

00:07:38.230 --> 00:07:41.900
"Evacuation Best Friend Killer:

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:44.110
Bowel-Emptying Amicide"!

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:47.530
How many times do
I have to say I didn't poop?

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:48.490
Anyway,

00:07:48.490 --> 00:07:52.120
now that your stomach is better,
let's hurry to the north gate.

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:55.500
Alicia and Mizarisa might
have gone there already.

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:59.790
Th-That's right! We have to help Tesla!

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:10.260
Focus, troops. Don't falter.

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:12.050
Yes, sir!

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:17.560
Th-There are so many!

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:21.230
Just one goblin would be a huge threat!

00:08:21.230 --> 00:08:23.860
Even for Tesla, it's too much...

00:08:23.860 --> 00:08:25.690
Charge!

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:42.790
Lightning Extreme!

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:49.170
T-Tesla's amazing.

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:52.470
But he can't do it all himself.

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:57.680
Mizarisa?!

00:08:57.680 --> 00:08:59.640
You can defeat a goblin?

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:03.810
Well, kinda, just barely
and by the skin of my teeth.

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:09.610
Watermelon...

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:12.320
...Split!

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:18.080
Chopping Apples!

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:27.550
I-Incredible! I didn't know
they were this strong!

00:09:27.550 --> 00:09:30.590
Lightning Extreme!

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:37.180
Get ready. Here I go!

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:57.870
You've got Tesla, Mizarisa, and Alicia!

00:09:57.870 --> 00:09:59.540
A fantastic lineup!

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:02.330
Doesn't it look like you'll
clear this stage of the game?

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:05.170
Y-Yes! It really does.

00:10:05.170 --> 00:10:11.090
All right! Now Tesla won't end up dying!
And my chance of survival is way up!

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:13.470
Report!

00:10:13.470 --> 00:10:18.510
Goblins have breached the south gate
and are invading Queen Govern's estate.

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:20.100
H-How?

00:10:20.100 --> 00:10:25.350
The south gate is robust iron! And I
stationed multiple talented Guards there!

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:26.810
Unfortunately,

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:32.530
a powerful goblin
destroyed the iron doors...

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:36.240
One-Eye?

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:38.330
"One-Eye"?

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:40.040
We'll have to talk later, Hiro.

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:41.950
Everyone, to Queen Govern's estate!

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:43.830
Yes, sir!

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:49.670
A-Are you two okay?

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:51.550
I'm fine.

00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:55.050
But Amos and Palù...

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:57.970
Those two...

00:10:57.970 --> 00:11:00.810
I didn't like them, but...

00:11:00.810 --> 00:11:03.730
...they ran away in fear of the goblins.

00:11:03.730 --> 00:11:06.020
Those two!

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:08.810
Few Guards can still fight.

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:11.360
Hiro, join Captain Tesla.

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:13.610
O-Of course!

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:32.500
What is <i>that</i>?

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:35.880
That's the king of the goblins...

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:39.300
...One-Eye!

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:54.740
One-Eye. He must be the reason
for the 0.1% chance of survival!

00:11:54.740 --> 00:11:59.280
I fought him once, several years ago.

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:02.700
After reports of a goblin
hunting humans near the city,

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:05.750
I was dispatched to investigate.

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:10.830
I only managed to injure his eye,
and it took all I had to escape.

00:12:12.090 --> 00:12:14.840
The cage! Transport the cage here.

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:16.590
Yes, sir!

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:19.260
Hiro.

00:12:21.430 --> 00:12:23.180
Are you ready?

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:26.390
We have to defeat One-Eye.

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:29.190
Then we can leave the city together.

00:12:29.190 --> 00:12:31.520
D-Don't do it, Tesla!

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:34.860
It'll trigger your death flag!

00:12:36.280 --> 00:12:37.860
Over here, One-Eye!

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:42.240
The man who destroyed
your eye stands before you!

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:50.790
Wh-What speed...

00:12:53.920 --> 00:12:55.880
Tesla...

00:13:02.470 --> 00:13:07.640
It's okay. You don't need to think about
anything other than peeing yourself.

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:11.690
Do you have to say
stuff like that right now?

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:15.110
In all seriousness,
you should just sit this out.

00:13:15.110 --> 00:13:17.190
This one's quite dangerous.

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:19.400
B-But I...

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:23.030
She's right. Leave him to us.

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:25.620
A-Alicia, you're here...

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:31.670
Captain Tesla is the pride of the city.
I can't allow a goblin to kill him.

00:13:31.670 --> 00:13:37.710
Oh, my. That was just
a teensy bit well said, you freak.

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:42.430
They reached an understanding?

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:45.640
I don't really get it,
but this might work out!

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:50.270
Hiro, Tesla mentioned
bringing a cage earlier, right?

00:13:50.270 --> 00:13:51.730
Y-Yes.

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:54.190
He did send someone to do that.

00:13:54.190 --> 00:13:57.690
That must've been
some sort of foreshadowing.

00:13:57.690 --> 00:14:00.900
In other words, maybe if you survive
One-Eye's attacks until the cage arrives,

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:03.320
you'll have a chance to win.

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:04.700
I see.

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:10.870
Okay, Captain Tesla!
Here come your reinforcements!

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:14.460
You can do it, Mizarisa!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:23.130
Mizarisa!

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:29.560
It's okay, Hiro.
Looks like she's just unconscious.

00:14:29.560 --> 00:14:32.020
O-Oh, good.

00:14:32.020 --> 00:14:34.770
She's a pervert,
but I'm glad she's not dead.

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:36.560
But what just happened?

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:41.030
That thing just kicked
Mizarisa in the stomach.

00:14:41.030 --> 00:14:43.030
<i>I'll </i>handle this.

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:46.120
Alicia.

00:14:50.580 --> 00:14:54.920
U-Um, can you tell what's
happening right now?

00:14:54.920 --> 00:14:56.290
Nope.

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:58.090
I thought not.

00:14:58.090 --> 00:15:01.460
This must be the climax of this section.

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:05.720
Shouldn't the protagonist be
able to at least see the battle?!

00:15:05.720 --> 00:15:08.390
Oh! Hiro, look there!

00:15:10.350 --> 00:15:11.930
All right! It's the cage!

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:13.480
The cage is here!

00:15:13.480 --> 00:15:15.730
Wait, what?

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:24.110
What are these goblins?

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:26.280
They're part of Captain Tesla's plan!

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:31.290
If One-Eye sees these goblins,
he might be thrown off and falter!

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:34.410
Look!

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:36.960
Here are some of your
newly captured comrades!

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:38.670
Do you see them?

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:47.800
I-It's working!

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:51.220
So these things do have some intelligence.

00:16:02.820 --> 00:16:04.940
It's over, One-Eye!

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:07.990
A-All right! The tables have turned!

00:16:07.990 --> 00:16:12.030
We did it! Now you'll
clear the goblin event, Hiro!

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:16.460
We've cleared the 0.1% chance hurdle!

00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:22.040
Well, it turns out that Kamui was
exaggerating a little with his statement.

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:25.300
Chance of survival: 0.1%.

00:16:25.300 --> 00:16:27.220
Die!

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:28.430
No, hold on.

00:16:28.430 --> 00:16:35.770
This is Kamui. Would that supreme asshole
exaggerate anything about this game?

00:16:35.770 --> 00:16:40.440
But once you clear it,
you'll encounter the true mystery of Ted.

00:16:40.440 --> 00:16:43.320
Try to keep your eyes open,

00:16:43.320 --> 00:16:45.900
and <i>think</i>.

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:50.070
The true mystery of Ted?
Keep my eyes open and think?

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:53.910
What did that mean? What did he mean?

00:16:53.910 --> 00:16:56.830
I can't think! Be quiet for a sec!

00:16:56.830 --> 00:16:58.620
Hey, wait.

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:01.250
I've heard this noise before.

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:09.930
It can't be...

00:17:09.930 --> 00:17:11.140
That's crazy...

00:17:11.140 --> 00:17:14.640
B-But it's true...

00:17:14.640 --> 00:17:18.310
Wait, Tesla!

00:17:18.310 --> 00:17:21.810
What is it, Hiro?
Why did you tell me to wait?

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:27.860
Tesla, were the goblins in this cage
not actually captured recently,

00:17:27.860 --> 00:17:32.070
but abducted long ago?

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:35.740
H-Hiro, what on earth are you saying?

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:39.370
First, it was your stomach.
Is something wrong with your head now?

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:40.960
Don't talk right now, Reona.

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:42.290
Ouchie!

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:49.210
When I was being tortured, when I was
training, and when Ginji was imprisoned--

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:51.970
I've heard their voices multiple times!

00:17:51.970 --> 00:17:55.850
I thought it was the wailing
of prisoners being held underground.

00:17:55.850 --> 00:17:57.810
But it wasn't!

00:17:57.810 --> 00:18:01.310
It was the howling of goblins!

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:05.770
These goblins were already in the prison!

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:08.860
Their eyes are pale and dull.

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:14.700
That's a sign that they've been held
in a dark place for a long time, isn't it?

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:19.580
In short, they were abducted
and confined years ago!

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:22.660
Only one person could do that, Tesla.

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:24.670
That person is you!

00:18:24.670 --> 00:18:29.510
Hiro, this is a full-dive RPG,
not a mystery novel!

00:18:29.510 --> 00:18:32.050
You detective nerd! I don't get this!

00:18:32.050 --> 00:18:35.090
Besides, Tesla has no reason to--

00:18:49.070 --> 00:18:50.730
T-Tesla!

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:53.320
I told you to wait!

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:58.120
Why, you surprised me, Hiro.

00:18:58.120 --> 00:19:02.790
You're smarter than I thought.

00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:05.000
It's just as you said.

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:10.000
I kidnapped the goblins
in this cage seven years ago.

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:13.300
And One-Eye over here...

00:19:13.300 --> 00:19:16.680
...was their father.

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:20.640
S-Seriously?

00:19:20.640 --> 00:19:22.100
But that's...

00:19:22.100 --> 00:19:27.150
Captain Tesla,
why would you do such a thing?

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:33.570
That's...

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:39.780
Queen Govern!

00:19:45.710 --> 00:19:48.500
Tesla, you killed him?

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:51.670
Yes. There were unforeseen circumstances.

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:53.260
I see.

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:54.920
Well, no matter.

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:58.970
You can just take
another goblin's children.

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:04.220
Queen Govern! Why do any of this?

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:10.150
Fear of goblins is the perfect tool to
keep the populace bound to the city.

00:20:10.150 --> 00:20:12.230
Keep them... bound?

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:14.190
What do you mean?

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:19.530
This city is outside the control
of every kingdom in Auberdine.

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:24.240
A fully independent territory
operating on the same level as a nation.

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:27.160
That is the city of Ted.

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:32.130
Goblins are actually
a fairly intelligent race.

00:20:34.590 --> 00:20:41.300
As long as they are unprovoked,
they rarely ever attack humans.

00:20:42.430 --> 00:20:49.310
However, I realized that their
ferocity when enraged could be used.

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:53.230
To check those who would
approach from outside,

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:59.150
and to bind the fools who
would try to leave the inside.

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:03.120
A tool for us to rule the city.

00:21:03.120 --> 00:21:07.160
That is the true nature
of these pitiful beasts.

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:08.120
Yes.

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:12.420
All of this is to maintain our kingdom.

00:21:16.090 --> 00:21:17.920
Wh-What an asshole!

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:20.180
I had no idea he was such a deadbeat!

00:21:20.180 --> 00:21:23.850
And he was my favorite NPC, too!

00:21:23.850 --> 00:21:25.720
First Kamui and now Tesla...

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:28.060
You have bad luck with men, Reona.

00:21:28.060 --> 00:21:30.440
Shut up!

00:21:33.440 --> 00:21:35.360
O-Oh crap!

00:21:40.490 --> 00:21:44.370
Tesla! You killed your own men?!

00:21:44.370 --> 00:21:52.500
All those who learn Ted's secret,
as well as those who get close, must die.

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:55.840
Naturally, Hiro,

00:21:55.840 --> 00:21:58.710
that includes you.

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:05.220
Thundering Tesla, the strongest NPC,
tougher than even the king of goblins.

00:22:05.220 --> 00:22:08.930
I have to defeat him to leave the city!

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:14.350
This is the true 0.1%
survival-chance hurdle!

00:23:45.650 --> 00:23:49.950
Reality⨯VR

00:23:45.990 --> 00:23:49.580
Episode 12: Reality⨯VR.
